# Safe_C++ GCC Plugin Auto-Loading Specs File
# This file instructs GCC/G++ to load the Safe_C++ plugin by default for all compilations.
# To disable Safe_C++, pass -DSAFE_CPP_DISABLE or -fplugin-arg-safe_cpp-disable to gcc/g++.

*cc1_options:
+ %{!DSAFE_CPP_DISABLE:%{!fplugin-arg-safe_cpp-disable:%{!fplugin-arg-memsentinel-disable:-fplugin=safe_cpp}}}

*cc1plus_options:
+ %{!DSAFE_CPP_DISABLE:%{!fplugin-arg-safe_cpp-disable:%{!fplugin-arg-memsentinel-disable:-fplugin=safe_cpp}}}

*link:
+ %{!DSAFE_CPP_DISABLE:%{!fplugin-arg-safe_cpp-disable:%{!nodefaultlibs:%{!nostdlib:-lsafe_cpp_rt}}}}
